sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Dagster in the cluster
    participant H as Healthchecks.io
    participant O as Operator
    D->>H: ping after each successful run, every 30 minutes
    Note over D: the node stops, nothing is sent
    Note over H: no ping within the schedule plus the grace period
    H->>O: e-mail: the check is down
    Note over D: the node is back and a run fails
    D->>H: call /fail with the job, the run ID and the error
    H->>O: e-mail at once
    D->>H: the next successful run pings
    Note over H: the check is up again
